PoxMeteorFalls_Text_JirachiSage::
	.string "SAGE: It fell asleep the moment it\n"
	.string "reached this ledge. It has not\l"
	.string "woken since.\p"
	.string "The young BAGON come down to the\n"
	.string "water each night to watch it glow.\p"
	.string "MORTY said to stay until it feels\n"
	.string "safe. A wish is a heavy thing to\l"
	.string "carry. Show me you can carry it.$"

PoxMeteorFalls_Text_JirachiSageDefeat::
	.string "SAGE: Your POKéMON never once\n"
	.string "looked up for help.\p"
	.string "Then JIRACHI is yours to wake.$"
